/target
Cargo.lock
**/*.rs.bk
.idea
.vscode
.claude/
.env
.superpowers/

# Sampling profiler outputs — regenerated on demand via the profile_harness
# example. Large (~80 MB each) and binary, so not committed. Instructions to
# reproduce live in docs/profiling/*.md.
docs/profiling/raw/

# Raw datasets — too big to commit (10GB+ each). The deduplicated
# distillates that ship with each service ARE committed (e.g.
# internot/data/first_names.json, internot/data/last_names.json),
# since they're include_str!()'d at compile time. Build scripts that
# turn datasets/* into committed JSONs live alongside their service
# (e.g. internot/build_names.py).
datasets/
*.zip
chat.txt

# Reference PDFs dropped in the project root for inspection.
# The actual papers don't belong in the repo.
*.pdf

# Tailwind standalone binary — install via internot_web/setup_styles.sh.
# The compiled CSS output (internot_web/static/style.css) IS committed
# so `cargo run` works without tailwind installed locally.
internot_web/bin/
internot_web/node_modules
internot_web/.next
